# Cloudflare Pages _redirects — see https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
# Force apex (www -> non-www) so canonical URLs are consistent for SEO.
# /book is served directly (book.html hands off to the talech online scheduler).

https://www.elitespautah.com/* https://elitespautah.com/:splat 301
/home https://elitespautah.com/ 301

# Pricing restructure (2026-06-13): hot stone, cupping, infrared sauna are now add-ons.
/hot-stone-massage      /services   301
/cupping-therapy        /services   301
/medical-infrared-sauna /services   301

# Staff receipt-reprint tool -> private n8n hosted form (not linked publicly). 302 so the target URL can change.
/print https://spa-phone-booking.andrew-86d.workers.dev/reprint 302

# Internal repo files must never be publicly served. This is a static-HTML Pages
# project with no build step, so Cloudflare publishes the whole repo root — every
# committed file is reachable, and robots.txt invites GPTBot/ClaudeBot/PerplexityBot
# to read them. 301 to / because Pages _redirects does NOT support a 404 status
# (docs list 404 as an unsupported example; only 301/302/303/307/308 and 200 work).
# robots.txt, 404.html and the domain-verification .txt stay public.
/CLAUDE.md  /  301
/PRODUCT.md  /  301
/README.md  /  301
/content-gaps.md  /  301
/build_services.py  /  301
/chat-widget.py  /  301
/.gitignore  /  301